chx:Scope a res:ResearchScope ; res:hasResearchQuestion "What does chapter 24 of the 3rd edition teach about speech from text with pyttsx3, text from speech with Whisper, subtitle files and downloading with yt-dlp, which of its statements still hold for the current releases of those packages and for Python 3.14.4, what could be executed offline here, and what must an advanced course add?" ; res:hasTimeWindow "Current as of 2026-10-01." .
